WEBVTT

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:40.280
It's already been a month since
we arrived in this unknown land.

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:42.450
We continue south,
guided by Filia.

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:45.520
All we see before us now
is unmapped wilderness.

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.600
Among the many things
I learned from Rezo...

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:51.360
...my ability to plot our position
is coming in most handy.

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:53.200
Ironic, isn't it?

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.930
I see it! That's the temple
of the Fire Dragon King!

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:56.770
We're almost there!

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:01.240
Where are we traveling
to in this unknown land?

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.840
My name is Zelgadis.

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:07.610
An unfortunate chimera, who wanders
the wastelands of his own soul.

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:22.000
If we walk along this wall here,
we'll get to the temple soon!

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:26.760
Oh... Now we can take the first
step towards saving the world!

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.440
What's going on here?

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.480
We walked all day
, but it doesn't seem any closer.

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:40.440
How much further is it to the
temple of the Fire Dragon King?

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.380
Hmm... Let's see...

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:47.520
Walking day and night at full
speed, about three more days.

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:50.950
Okay, that's it.
I'm so hungry, I can't move.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:54.660
What a continent.
It's just so huge...

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:57.830
We just got careless because
we could finally see the temple.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:01.030
Forget it... I'm not walking
another step, no matter what.

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:03.100
Hey, can we just
camp here tonight?

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:04.840
Yeah...

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.340
I can't bring myself to go on,
so I guess we have no choice.

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:11.880
What are you saying?!
You were all so excited before!

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:14.710
That was hours ago!

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:17.340
We don't have any
strength left to go anywhere.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:20.080
But this is to save the world
from the prophecized destruction!

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:23.690
WE'RE gonna be
destroyed before the world is!

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:26.520
Miss Lina! Miss Lina!

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:30.060
I see some light just
a little way up ahead.

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:36.540
All right! A town!
We can finally get some food!

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:37.770
Food?!

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.770
All right! Food! Food!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.370
I'll take anything, as long as
it's food! Lina, let's go!

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.940
Right behind you, Gourry!

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:46.350
Food! Food! Food!

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:49.910
But... They had plenty
of strength left in them.

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:51.780
Shall we join them?

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:54.020
Um... Yes.

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:58.320
Wow! Look at the
size of those ruins!

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:01.490
And this town's so
small in comparison.

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:03.760
This town's name is Explaina...

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:07.060
...and those ruins are its
chief tourist attraction.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.900
They're thousands of years old.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:11.800
Leave the ruins for later!

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:15.000
Right now, we're here
for food! Food! Let's go!

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.070
Yeah!

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.710
Food! Food! Food! Food!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:24.750
We've gotta take care of them
if we're gonna get Gorun Nova.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.520
We're fine! We'll slip 'em this.

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:31.490
A grooly fruit. One of those
can knock out a giant ogre.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.030
They're so... crude.

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.270
They're always like that.
Pay it no mind.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.870
Hey, Pops! Where's the rest?!
Bring us the rest!

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:52.940
Um, look... I'd kinda
like to close up now.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:56.990
- Bring the rest!
- Right. Coming right up...

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:08.130
Say, Filia. About those ruins.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.500
The style seems to suggest
the Dragon race built them.

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:13.630
That's right. But the
ruins are sealed now...

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.040
...and no one is
allowed inside them.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:19.330
Sealed ruins, huh?

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:21.840
Don't you dare!

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:24.780
Saving the world from the
prophecized destruction comes first!

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:27.040
Please go to sleep soon so you
can regain your strength!

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:28.950
We'll be setting
out early tomorrow!

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:31.540
And Miss Lina, are you
going to eat all night?!

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:35.620
But we still haven't gotten
the extra stuff we ordered!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.220
You're STI LL eating?!

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.350
Okay, here you go.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:39.920
All right! At last! At last!

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:43.130
This is the
specialty of the house.

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:47.070
Now savor it, eat it up,
and please leave already!

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:48.970
Looks great!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:49.900
Down the...

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:50.840
...hatch!

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:57.100
Oh, would you stop already?!

00:05:57.180 --> 00:06:00.120
First of all, who do you
think is paying this bill?!

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:02.780
Me, that's who!
I'll eat this all myself!

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:09.390
Oh, I told you to savor it first...

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:13.990
All right, everyone,
tomorrow's an early day for us.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:16.730
So, please go to
...sleep... now...

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.090
Filia!

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:24.430
What the? She's asleep!

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:26.670
Talk about being
able to sleep anywhere!

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:30.780
Miss Filia must have been
more tired than she looked.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:35.610
Please, Elder...
May I have a raise?

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:42.120
Zel!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.620
No fair, sneaking in alone.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:45.720
Lina...

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:52.490
Sealed ruins, huh? I'll bet there's
some sort of treasure in there.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:57.500
Or maybe we'll find some way to
turn your body back to normal.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:58.540
Yeah.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:01.970
Look, that's great,
but Filia's really heavy!

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.300
You'd never know it to look at her!

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:06.780
Well, she really is
a dragon, after all.

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:09.340
You gotta expect her to weigh
more than a normal person.

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:14.020
The only one who ate the fruit
of the grooly sleep tree...

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:16.020
...was that dragon girl.

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:17.460
What'll we do, Boss?

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:19.760
The only thing we can
do now is follow them.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.330
Hey, Lina!

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:29.060
What? What's up?

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:30.960
Look at this.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.840
Whoa...
This is pretty impressive.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.210
So, what's it say?

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:39.410
I don't know. However...

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:46.520
There appears to be a large
room just beyond this wall.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:50.380
Well, logically, this writing
must have a keyword...

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:53.520
...to get you into that room, but...

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:57.560
Oh, my. So when did
you turn from being...

00:07:57.630 --> 00:07:59.970
...a bandit killer to
a tomb raider, Lina?

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:01.660
Xellos!

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:02.800
Hi there.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.670
Anyway, Lina, to just
stand by and let you...

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:10.010
...take the Dragon race's treasure
would be wrong, wouldn't it?

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:12.050
You're really one to talk.

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:14.810
So, Xellos, can you
read this writing?

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:16.440
Oh? You mean this?

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:21.220
Oh, I see...

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.050
What's it say?!

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:28.760
In ancient times, there was a highly-
developed culture in this land.

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.890
Ancient times? From the War
of the Monsters' Fall?

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:35.730
No, these ruins are more
than a thousand years old.

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:39.400
Built with techniques and powers
from tens of thousands of years ago...

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:42.770
...this represents knowledge
on a level with the Claire Bible!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.840
On the level of the Claire Bible?!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.270
So? So?
What else does it say?!

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:50.050
Well, that's...

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:51.110
That's what?

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:52.810
Something I can't read at all.

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:57.580
But I'm sure Filia
would be able to read it.

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:01.260
That's right! Exactly!
Zel, wake up Filia!

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:07.090
Hey, Filia! Wake up! Hey!

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:09.000
Oh, well...

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.170
Digger Bolt!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.700
Agh! Quit it! Quit it!

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:15.740
Let me go, Lina!

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:18.410
You'll kill her
before waking her up!

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:20.510
I thought you wanted her up now!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.780
All you'd be getting from
her is some reflex movement!

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:29.650
No way...

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:35.090
Oh... What is going
on here?! Where am I?

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.500
What am I doing here?!

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.100
Filia's bracelet!

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:54.340
I see. The Dragon race
themselves acted as the key.

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.510
This is no time to be
talking about that!

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:59.580
We have to get
out of here at once!

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:08.060
Too late...

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:10.860
Please stand clear
of the closing doors.

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:13.860
What's going on?

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:35.190
Thank you for riding this train.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:38.020
Next stop: Temple of
the Fire Dragon King.

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:40.490
Temple of the Fire Dragon King.

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:42.290
What is this?

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:44.390
A disaster!

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:45.730
All aboard!

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:15.040
What? What?!

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:16.370
Hey, we're moving!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:20.570
Oh! Without a
Dragon's gem or magic...

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:24.590
...it was just a harmless ruin!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:28.820
I see! This was a transportation
system used by the Dragon race!

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:32.390
Well, we'll get to the temple of the Fire
Dragon King immediately, won't we?

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:34.020
How can you be so calm?!

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:38.090
There are countless towns
built in the path of this thing!

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:42.740
This will be a disaster!
Take responsibility, you!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.630
Well, I'll see you all later.

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:46.700
Ooh! I'll never forgive him!

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.980
Look, first we have
to get off this thing!

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:50.100
Are you sure we should?

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.080
How can you be
so irresponsible?!

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.350
We're jumping off!

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:00.420
Wait, please! Listen to me!

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:09.200
Thought you could escape us by
making the ruins move, huh?

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:10.490
Well, you can't!

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:12.570
Who'd be stupid
enough to think THAT?!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.670
Now stop these ruins and
give us the Sword of Light!

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:17.170
Or else... Huh?!

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:21.840
Jillas!

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:22.740
Idiot...

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.380
Okay, we can fight
you for a little while.

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:26.140
Yeah!

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.210
We don't have time for that!

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:31.190
Fire... BALL!

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:37.120
What did you expect?!

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:42.360
All of your magic is being
absorbed by the ruins!

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:46.370
It gets converted to energy
to make the ruins move!

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.070
Why didn't you say so before?!

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:52.130
My Sword of Light!

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:55.970
Anything putting out
energy gets absorbed.

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:03.320
Without your magic or that sword,
you're nothing to be afraid of!

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:06.310
We'll finish you off like
a bunch of babies!

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.120
You really think so, huh?!

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.490
She's strong even bare-handed!

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:14.200
Impressed?

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.390
This is no time to be
gloating over beating him!

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:33.940
Stop! Stop!

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:43.950
This track goes right to
the temple?! What'll we do?!

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:48.630
It'll take us straight to the temple.
There'll be some casualties, but...

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:50.430
You must be joking!

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:53.640
We're going much
faster than we should!

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.430
So, you mean?

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:56.730
This is a runaway!

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:00.110
Probably because it
was built so long ago.

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:01.740
How does knowing THAT help us?!

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:03.250
Okay, in that case...

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:04.650
You're going to run away?

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:06.550
What about the temple
of the Fire Dragon King?

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.880
What are you talking about?
Our lives come first!

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:14.080
If you insist on acting like this...
I'll tell your big sister on you!

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:16.490
That's a low blow!

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:19.760
If you don't want me to,
then stop this thing right...!

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:22.790
The town!

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:24.830
We're going to crash!

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:29.200
So? What do we do?!
What do we do?!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:30.330
Let us pray.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:33.530
Maybe it'll stop if we do that.

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:35.310
You wanna die even SOONER?!

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:38.140
Oh, I offer these sacrifices
to protect the sacred temple...

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:40.310
Speak for yourself!

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.450
What are WE supposed to do?!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.650
Oh, this tea tastes so nice.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.400
Are you all right?

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:01.800
Yeah... I think so.

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:02.670
Hey!

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:05.170
Oh, you really went
and did it before!

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:10.440
Looks like we both have the
devil's own luck on our side!

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:12.450
Heh... Silence.

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:20.950
It's been a while since I've
killed someone with my sword.

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:21.990
It's thirsty for blood!

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:30.390
Whoa! Whoa! Hold it!
Don't get so excited!

00:15:30.470 --> 00:15:32.370
Hey, Jillas!
Let 'em have it!

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:33.770
Sure thing!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.520
We're still going!

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:58.190
The temple... We're almost there!
We're going to crash!

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:00.860
Hey, you're right.
Wow, this is really something.

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:05.100
Oh, well. We've gotta
stop these ruins, I guess.

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:06.930
Isn't there some way to do it?

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:09.230
Huh? Um, well, uh...

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:11.710
Break it.

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:16.070
If we break the device which
absorbs magical energy, then...

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:17.770
And where is that?

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:18.970
I don't know!

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:21.450
Okay, then!

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.650
We'll destroy everything that
LOOKS like it might be it. Got that!

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:25.690
Yeah!

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:38.170
And another town bites the dust...

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:39.760
Would you concentrate?

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:44.200
We will soon be arriving at the
temple of the Fire Dragon King.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.970
Please be sure to collect any
items you've brought with you.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.500
Oh, stop it, please!
This is more valuable...

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:52.950
...than the treasures of
every kingdom put together!

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:54.640
Agh! We're almost to the temple!

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.650
Hey, we've smashed
almost everything...

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:01.210
...but it doesn't look like we broke
what we were looking for.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.280
The only thing left is...

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:05.650
Hmm... There it is!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:07.560
What? No! Not that!

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:11.060
That is the holiest of holy
objects to the Dragon race!

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.060
Never mind! Gourry, take it out!

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:14.830
Right!

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:16.300
Light, come forth!

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:19.310
Hold on a second, will you?

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:20.400
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:28.150
Oh, we'll be SO cursed now!

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:36.620
I think that's what's
absorbing the magic!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.090
ALL RIGHT!!!

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.790
Um, my sword can't reach it...

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:50.700
Oh! All it'd
take is one fireball!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.610
I have an idea! Why not give
US the Sword of Light?

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:58.210
Would you shut up?!

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:00.770
We don't have time
to fight you guys!

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:04.350
This isn't gonna be like
last time! Get 'em!

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:05.450
Sure thing!

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:14.860
What?

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:19.500
Darn it! Those things are
as powerful as fireballs...

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:20.560
That's it!

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:21.930
Gourry!

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:27.800
Come on! Come on! Over here!

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:30.140
You don't like us, you big animal?
Then come and get us! Wimp!

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.310
Animal! You big zero!

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:32.810
That does it...

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:39.420
Gourry!

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:41.050
Leave it to me!

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:50.730
Yes!

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:55.300
All right! My power's back!

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:58.340
We're still moving?!

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:01.540
That's because of
the size of this thing.

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:02.870
We may have cut the power...

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.240
...but it'll keep moving on
inertia for a while longer.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.210
Jillas!

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:10.010
Okay, everyone?
We've gotta get out of here!

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:12.610
Get out of here? We still
haven't stopped the ruins!

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:15.290
Filia! Turn into a dragon!

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:16.950
I can't do that
in front of people!

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:18.620
TRANSFORM!

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:19.990
NO!!!

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.060
Ray Wing!

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:33.170
The temple! The temple!

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:35.300
All right! I'll stop it
with one shot!

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:40.320
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows!"

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:42.280
"Buried in the flow of time..."

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:46.080
"In thy great name,
I pledge myself to darkness!"

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.590
"Let all the fools who stand
before us be destroyed..."

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:53.220
"...by the power
you and I possess!"

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:56.700
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:03.800
Did it work?

00:20:04.110 --> 00:20:06.100
All right! Safe by a hair!

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.500
Thank goodness! Thank goodness!

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:22.510
Final stop: Temple of
the Fire Dragon King.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:24.860
Temple of the Fire Dragon King.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:35.230
Well, we're here.

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:39.870
Yeah, we're here.
We're definitely here...

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:42.280
I'm amazed we're still alive.

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:43.470
What a farce this was.

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:47.310
Come on, at least we made it to
the temple of the Fire Dragon King!

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:50.180
Right, Filia? C'mon, Filia!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:55.120
Oh, my! So this is
how it turned out!

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:55.990
Mr. Xellos?

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:01.260
Filia! C'mon, Filia, wake up!

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:03.770
Filia!

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:29.350
At last, we're here!
So, what do you guys want us to do?

00:22:29.420 --> 00:22:32.790
Next time, " A Peace Conference?
This is the Dragon Shrine?"

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:35.590
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
